I walk over to a shelf with bread.
I am looking for a local classic.
I would like to have a Danish rye bread.
I look at the shelf.
I find a rye bread.
It is in a bag.
I look at the bag.
I take the rye bread.
I lift the bread.
I am surprised.
The bread is very heavy.
It feels like a stone!
I like light bread.
But the rye bread is dark and heavy.
I carefully lay the bread in the basket.
The basket is also heavy now.
